## Delete an artist {{ tag: 'DELETE', label: '/api/artists/:id' }}

<Row>
  <Col>

    Soft-deletes an artist and returns it. Requires the admin role.

    ### Required parameters

    <Properties>
      <Property name="id" type="number">
        Unique identifier of the item.
      </Property>
    </Properties>

    ### Optional parameters

    <Properties>
      <Property name="cascade" type={"\\"true\\" | \\"false\\", optional"}>
        Set to \`true\` to delete the albums and tracks too.
      </Property>
    </Properties>

    ### Response attributes

    <Properties>
      <Property name="data" type="object">
        The artist. See [the artist model](#the-artist-model).
      </Property>
    </Properties>

    ### Errors

    <Properties>
      <Property name="400" type="error">
        The id is not a number, or a query parameter is invalid.
      </Property>
      <Property name="401" type="error">
        Missing or invalid credentials.
      </Property>
      <Property name="403" type="error">
        The caller is signed in but is not an admin, or the request is a cookie write from an origin that is not allowed.
      </Property>
      <Property name="404" type="error">
        No item has the requested id, or it has been deleted.
      </Property>
      <Property name="409" type="error">
        The artist still has albums. Pass \`cascade=true\` to delete them too.
      </Property>
    </Properties>

  </Col>
